NAME
    log - toggle the global diagnostic logging master switch

SYNOPSIS
    log off
    log on
    log status

DESCRIPTION
    Controls the process-wide master logging switch across all trace and
    diagnostic log flags without altering any individual flag's configured
    setting. Turning logging off silences all diagnostic output; turning
    it back on restores whichever individual flags were enabled before.

OPTIONS
    off
        Disable diagnostic logging globally without changing individual
        flag settings.

    on
        Re-enable diagnostic logging using each flag's saved state.

    status
        Print whether the master logging switch is currently on or off.

EXAMPLES
    log status
    log off
    log on

EXIT STATUS
    0   Command completed (or usage message printed).
    1   Session service fault.

SEE ALSO
    trace(1), bp(1), framelog(1)
